# <Nivi Start>
# Files that must never enter the Docker build context.
#
# node_modules is here for correctness, not size: the locally installed bcrypt is a
# native module compiled for Windows, and it will not load on the Linux base image.
node_modules
.git
.gitignore

# Credentials, in every shape the name can take. ".env" alone was not enough: a file
# called "..env" is a different name, and one reached the public repository on
# 30 July 2026 for exactly that reason. The Dockerfile copies named directories rather
# than the whole context, so nothing here could reach the image today, but this is the
# layer that keeps that true after someone adds a convenient `COPY . .`.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk

# Test and tooling files. They are not needed at runtime and every extra file is
# another thing shipped to production that nobody reviews.
tests
.github
.vscode
*.md
!README.md
# <Nivi End>
